      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "水名，具体所指待考。一说即位于今广东、广西边界的贺江"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-01-32",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "曰鸡山，其上多金，其下多丹雘。黑水出焉，而南流注于海。其中有𫚋鱼"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-02-33",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "丘，无草木。洵水出焉，南流注于黑水，其中多丹粟，多青雄黄。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 11,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-11-08",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "即黑水山，山名，具体所指待考"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 11,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-11-08",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "西行又南行昆仑之虚，西南入海，黑水之山。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 11,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-11-08",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "，黑水之山"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 11,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-11-14",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "水名，具体所指待考。一说可能是喀什喀尔河"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 11,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-11-14",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "洋水、黑水出西北隅，以东，东行，又东北，"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 15,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-15-03",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "水名，具体所指待考。一说是越南境内的黑水河"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 15,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-15-03",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "有荣山，荣水出焉。黑水之南，有玄蛇，食麈。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 15,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-15-05",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "四鸟。有渊四方，四隅皆达，北属黑水，南属大荒，北旁名曰少和之渊，"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 15,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-15-06",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "大荒之中，有不姜之山，黑水穷焉。又有贾山，汔水出焉。又有"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-18-05",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "《山海经》中有多条河流称为黑水，较多的是指西部发源于昆仑山的一条。一说此处指今四川岷江上游支流黑水河"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-18-05",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "流沙之东，黑水之西，有朝云之国、司彘之国。黄"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-18-06",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "这里指岷江"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-18-06",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "流沙之东，黑水之间，有山名不死之山。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-18-08",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "西南黑水之间，有都广之野，后稷葬焉。爰"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-18-09",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "南海之外，黑水青水之间，有木名曰若木，若水出"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-18-16",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "水名，具体所指待考"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 18,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-18-16",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "北海之内，有山名曰幽都之山，黑水出焉。其上有玄鸟、玄蛇、玄豹、"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "entryId": "chuci-03-02",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "\n一蛇吞象,\n\n厥大何如？\n\n黑水玄趾,\n\n三危安在？\n\n延年不"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-05-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "谓六水？曰：河水、赤水、辽水、黑水、江水、淮水。\n\n阖四海之内，"
    }
  ],
